                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "No real reason to buy this over L4D2 If i’m being honest..\n\nL4D2 has all the content this game has + workshop support.\n\nIt’s not completely the same game however, there are some differences in the maps and the gameplay. But they are minor and unlikely to be noticed by the average player.\n\nIt’s also pretty much dead thanks to its successful sequel. No one plays this game anymore.\n\nIt’s still fun to play, I’ll give it that. The atmosphere in this one feels different compared to the second game. I don’t know how to explain it, but this game feels darker and grim.\n\nIt’s dirt cheap when on sale, so I still recommend getting it. But overall, if you were forced to pick one. Buy the second game.",
